NAME
    gcloud apihub curations - manage Curation resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud apihub curations COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Curation resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create a Curation.

     delete
        Delete a Curation.

     describe
        Describe a Curation.

     list
        List Curations.

     update
        Update a Curation.

NOTES
    This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha apihub curations

